      "sourceTextSha256": "ebe9e22f6180bd3310c49f82f822c0cf3d5b4d1cbf21e9d4cb4829ee8115d85a",
      "text": "After breakfast, transfer to the airport for your flight to Iguaçu, where a driver awaits you with a sign bearing your name for the transfer to your hotel. On the Iguaçu River, at the border between Brazil and Argentina and surrounded by lush rainforest, the falls are one of nature’s most extraordinary spectacles, to be experienced from both the Brazilian and the Argentine sides.",
