      "sourceTextSha256": "056e01049819274149a97a48ec3d29dcde63a26031f4e8e87e3e410cc82530b6",
      "text": "After breakfast, explore the Brazilian side along the Iguaçu River canyon, within a national park of unique flora and fauna. The 275 waterfalls converge towards the Devil’s Throat, among mist and rainbows, as you follow the paths past numerous smaller falls and viewpoints towards the most powerful section. Recommended optional activities, at an additional cost: the Macuco Safari boat adventure or the colourful Bird Park.",
